       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC300.
       AUTHOR.        P. GONZALES.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  06/02/91.
      ****************************************************************
      *  SUPPLIER MASTER MAINTENANCE
      *
      *  MODIFICATION LOG
      *  06/02/91 PG         CLONED FROM NWC100 (CUSTOMERS)
      *  09/30/95 PG   PG95  MOVED TO NORTHWIND FILES (SUPMST)
      *  03/03/97 PG   PG97  NEW NUMBER = HIGHEST ON FILE + 1
      *
      *  INDICATORS (WS-IND):  03 EXIT  06 ADD  12 CANCEL
      *    31 SFLDSP  32 SFLDSPCTL  33 SFLCLR  34 SFLEND
      *    40 PROTECT KEY  41 PROTECT ALL  51-66 FIELD IN ERROR
      ****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           CLASS PHONE-CHARS IS "0" THRU "9" " " "(" ")" "-" "." "+".
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC300D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT SUPMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-SUPMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS SM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PF-STAT.
           SELECT SUPMSTL1 ASSIGN TO DATABASE-SUPMSTL1
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS SL-KEY
               WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WS-LF-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  SUPMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY SUPMSTCP.
       FD  SUPMSTL1
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY SUPL1CP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-X                        PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-PF-STAT                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-LF-STAT                  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ERR                      PIC X     VALUE "N".
       77  WS-SAVE-POS                 PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-DTL-MSG                  PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-KEY                      PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-HIGH                     PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TODAY-AREA.
           05  WS-TODAY                PIC 9(6).
           05  WS-TODAY-R REDEFINES WS-TODAY.
               10  WS-T-YY             PIC 99.
               10  WS-T-MM             PIC 99.
               10  WS-T-DD             PIC 99.
       01  WS-MDY                      PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZERO.
      *  INDICATOR AREA FOR THE -SI DISPLAY FILE
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC300D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC300D.
       01  SFLCTL-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-I OF NWC300D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC300D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC300D.
       01  DTLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-I OF NWC300D.
       01  DTLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DTLREC-O OF NWC300D.
       01  DLTREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DLTREC-I OF NWC300D.
       01  DLTREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DLTREC-O OF NWC300D.
      *  MESSAGES
       01  WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "CUSTOMER NOT FOUND".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "SUPPLIER CHANGED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "SUPPLIER ADDED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "SUPPLIER DELETED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "CUSTOMER ALREADY ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "NO SUPPLIERS ON FILE".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "COMPANY NAME IS REQUIRED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "COUNTRY IS REQUIRED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "CUSTOMER NUMBER IS REQUIRED".
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40) VALUE
               "PHONE HAS INVALID CHARACTERS".
       01  WS-MSG-TABLE REDEFINES WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  WS-MSG                  PIC X(40) OCCURS 10 TIMES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE.
           OPEN I-O SUPMST.
           OPEN INPUT SUPMSTL1.
           ACCEPT WS-TODAY FROM DATE.
           COMPUTE WS-MDY = WS-T-MM * 10000 + WS-T-DD * 100 + WS-T-YY.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-I-AREA SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW-LIST.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO SFLCTL-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END-PGM.
           IF WS-IND(06) = B"1"
               PERFORM 4000-ADD THRU 4000-EXIT
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
           IF C1POS OF SFLCTL-I NOT = WS-SAVE-POS
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
       9000-END-PGM.
           CLOSE DSPFILE SUPMST SUPMSTL1.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  1000 - LOAD THE SUBFILE FROM THE POSITION-TO NAME (MAX 500)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD-SFL.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE C1POS OF SFLCTL-I TO WS-SAVE-POS.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-POS TO C1POS OF SFLCTL-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO SL-KEY.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-POS TO SL-NAME.
           START SUPMSTL1 KEY IS NOT LESS THAN SL-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ SUPMSTL1 NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE SL-SUP-NO TO S1SUP OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE SL-NAME TO S1NAME OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE SL-CITY TO S1CITY OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE SL-CNTY TO S1CNTY OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE SL-SUP-NO TO H1KEY OF SFLREC-O.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 500 GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31)
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-MSG(6) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  2000 - PROCESS OPTIONS TYPED IN THE SUBFILE
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           MOVE H1KEY OF SFLREC-I TO WS-KEY.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "2"
               PERFORM 3000-CHANGE THRU 3000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               PERFORM 5000-DELETE THRU 5000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "5"
               PERFORM 6000-DISPLAY THRU 6000-EXIT.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  3000 - CHANGE.  RECORD STAYS LOCKED WHILE THE SCREEN IS UP
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-CHANGE.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "CHANGE" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN THRU 7000-EXIT.
       3000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 3000-SHOW.
      *  READ AGAIN - EDIT MAY HAVE READ OTHER RECORDS OF THIS FILE
           MOVE WS-KEY TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE THRU 7100-EXIT.
           REWRITE SUPMST-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 3000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(2) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       3000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  4000 - ADD
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-ADD.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "ADD" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 4500-NEXT-NUMBER THRU 4500-EXIT.
           ADD 1 TO WS-HIGH GIVING D1SUP OF DTLREC-O.
       4000-SHOW.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           IF D1SUP OF DTLREC-I = ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(9) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
      *  DUPLICATE CHECK (A FOUND RECORD IS NOW LOCKED)
           MOVE D1SUP OF DTLREC-I TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST INVALID KEY GO TO 4000-NEW.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51).
           MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           GO TO 4000-SHOW.
       4000-NEW.
           PERFORM 8000-EDIT THRU 8000-EXIT.
           IF WS-ERR = "Y" GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           INITIALIZE SUPMST-REC.
           MOVE D1SUP OF DTLREC-I TO SM-SUP-NO.
           PERFORM 7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE THRU 7100-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACE TO SM-STAT.
           WRITE SUPMST-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(3) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  4500 - NEXT NUMBER = HIGHEST ON FILE + 1 (READS WHOLE FILE)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4500-NEXT-NUMBER.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-HIGH.
           MOVE ZERO TO SM-SUP-NO.
           START SUPMST KEY IS NOT LESS THAN SM-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 4500-EXIT.
       4500-READ.
           READ SUPMST NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 4500-EXIT.
           IF SM-SUP-NO > WS-HIGH MOVE SM-SUP-NO TO WS-HIGH.
           GO TO 4500-READ.
       4500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  5000 - DELETE (NO WHERE-USED CHECK)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       5000-DELETE.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DLTREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE SM-SUP-NO TO D2KEY OF DLTREC-O.
           MOVE SM-NAME TO D2NAME OF DLTREC-O.
           MOVE "N" TO D2CONF OF DLTREC-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DLTREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DLTREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO DLTREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "DLTREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           IF D2CONF OF DLTREC-I NOT = "Y" GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           DELETE SUPMST RECORD INVALID KEY GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MSG(4) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       5000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  6000 - DISPLAY ONLY (STILL READS FOR UPDATE)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       6000-DISPLAY.
           MOVE WS-KEY TO SM-SUP-NO.
           READ SUPMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO WS-MSG-LINE
                           GO TO 6000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE DTLREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE "DISPLAY" TO D1MODE OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(40).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(41).
           PERFORM 7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN THRU 7000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 7500-SHOW-DETAIL THRU 7500-EXIT.
       6000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7000 - FILE TO SCREEN
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7000-FILE-TO-SCREEN.
           MOVE SM-SUP-NO TO D1SUP OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-NAME TO D1NAME OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-CONT TO D1CONT OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-TITL TO D1TITL OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-ADDR TO D1ADDR OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-CITY TO D1CITY OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-REGN TO D1REGN OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-POST TO D1POST OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-CNTY TO D1CNTY OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-PHON TO D1PHON OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-FAX TO D1FAX OF DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SM-HOME TO D1HOME OF DTLREC-O.
       7000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7100 - SCREEN TO FILE (KEY IS NOT MOVED)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7100-SCREEN-TO-FILE.
           MOVE D1NAME OF DTLREC-I TO SM-NAME.
           MOVE D1CONT OF DTLREC-I TO SM-CONT.
           MOVE D1TITL OF DTLREC-I TO SM-TITL.
           MOVE D1ADDR OF DTLREC-I TO SM-ADDR.
           MOVE D1CITY OF DTLREC-I TO SM-CITY.
           MOVE D1REGN OF DTLREC-I TO SM-REGN.
           MOVE D1POST OF DTLREC-I TO SM-POST.
           MOVE D1CNTY OF DTLREC-I TO SM-CNTY.
           MOVE D1PHON OF DTLREC-I TO SM-PHON.
           MOVE D1FAX OF DTLREC-I TO SM-FAX.
           MOVE D1HOME OF DTLREC-I TO SM-HOME.
       7100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7500 - SHOW THE DETAIL SCREEN AND READ IT BACK
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7500-SHOW-DETAIL.
           MOVE WS-DTL-MSG TO D1MSG OF DTLREC-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DTLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO DTLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "DTLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
      *  KEEP WHAT THE USER TYPED IN CASE WE HAVE TO SHOW IT AGAIN
           MOVE CORRESPONDING DTLREC-I TO DTLREC-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DTL-MSG.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM 51 BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > 66
               MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(WS-X)
           END-PERFORM.
       7500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  8000 - EDIT THE SCREEN (STOPS AT THE FIRST ERROR)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       8000-EDIT.
           MOVE "N" TO WS-ERR.
           IF D1NAME OF DTLREC-I = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(52)
               MOVE WS-MSG(7) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           IF D1CNTY OF DTLREC-I = SPACES
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(59)
               MOVE WS-MSG(8) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
           IF D1PHON OF DTLREC-I IS NOT PHONE-CHARS
               MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(60)
               MOVE WS-MSG(10) TO WS-DTL-MSG
               GO TO 8000-EXIT.
      *  FAX CHECK TAKEN OUT - EUROPEAN FAX NUMBERS  PG 1997
      *   IF D1FAX OF DTLREC-I IS NOT PHONE-CHARS
      *       MOVE "Y" TO WS-ERR
      *       GO TO 8000-EXIT.
       8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
